3B.16 — Deliberation

When multiple actions remain viable:

\[
EU(a)=\sum_iP(O_i|E,S)U(O_i)
\]

and, where appropriate:

\[
DecisionScore(a)
=
EU(a)
-\lambda Risk(a)
-\mu Uncertainty(a)
-\nu Cost(a)
\]

But first apply hard constraints:

AUTHORITY
RISK LIMITS
EVIDENCE REQUIREMENTS
PORTFOLIO LIMITS
EXECUTION LIMITS
DEADLINES

Therefore:

HARD CONSTRAINTS
→ FILTER

DECISION OBJECTIVES
→ RANK

This is more practical than pretending one formula can decide everything.


